<div class="section">Venue</div>

<p>
All <a href="https://www.floc26.org/venue">FLoC</a> associated conferences and workshops have the same venue:<br>
<span class="address">Edifício II - ISCTE, Avenida das Forças Armadas, 1649-026 Lisboa, Portugal</span>
</p>

